3012
01:42:33,460 --> 01:42:35,960
めらめらめら飛べ飛べ飛べ飛べ！
Mera, mera, mera, jump, jump, jump, jump!

3013
01:42:35,960 --> 01:42:37,010
よいしょ！Thank you!
Heave-ho! Thank you!

3014
01:42:37,010 --> 01:42:39,160
No more hiding.

3015
01:42:39,160 --> 01:42:40,860
表情がなくなっちゃったんだ。
Her expression disappeared.

3016
01:42:40,860 --> 01:42:44,160
Now I'm shining like I'm born to be.

3017
01:42:44,660 --> 01:42:46,460
いけるかにょ？
Can we make it, nyo?

3018
01:42:46,460 --> 01:42:48,160
あ、もうすぐ上なんじゃない？
Ah, aren't we almost at the top?

3019
01:42:48,160 --> 01:42:49,160
よいしょ。
Heave-ho.

3020
01:42:48,960 --> 01:42:49,760
Okay.

3021
01:42:49,710 --> 01:42:51,260
Okay, great! Thank you!

3022
01:42:51,160 --> 01:42:51,960
Okay.

3023
01:42:51,960 --> 01:42:53,210
I see the smoke!

3024
01:42:53,110 --> 01:42:55,010
I see the smoke too!

3025
01:42:55,160 --> 01:42:57,810
Me too! 見えた！
Me too! I see it!

3026
01:42:57,810 --> 01:42:59,410
Let's go!

3027
01:42:59,460 --> 01:43:00,960
もうちょっと！
Just a little more!

3028
01:43:02,010 --> 01:43:03,360
Woo! 見えた！
Woo! I see it!

3029
01:43:02,760 --> 01:43:05,360
We see the smoke! We made it!

3030
01:43:05,160 --> 01:43:06,060
やった！
We did it!

3031
01:43:05,510 --> 01:43:06,610
We're pro.

3032
01:43:06,110 --> 01:43:07,960
やったのじゃ！
We did it, noja!

3033
01:43:11,160 --> 01:43:14,360
しかもヤシの木もあるよ。いっぱいある、ご飯。
Plus there are palm trees too! Lots of food.

3034
01:43:15,260 --> 01:43:16,960
Oh, lot of coconut!

3035
01:43:16,960 --> 01:43:19,160
Yes, lot of coconuts!

3036
01:43:18,160 --> 01:43:19,260
Ooh.

3037
01:43:19,260 --> 01:43:20,460
Nine? Nine of them?

3038
01:43:20,660 --> 01:43:21,860
What is this?

3039
01:43:22,960 --> 01:43:25,060
I have a knife!

3040
01:43:25,460 --> 01:43:28,260
We also have yellow berry!

3041
01:43:26,660 --> 01:43:28,660
We can sacrifice people! Oh, I can sacrifice people!

3042
01:43:28,660 --> 01:43:30,360
Oh, you can sacrifice people?

3043
01:43:30,360 --> 01:43:31,660
Uh-huh.

3044
01:43:31,660 --> 01:43:33,660
We can eat yellow berry?

3045
01:43:33,660 --> 01:43:35,160
I want the knife.

3046
01:43:35,060 --> 01:43:35,960
Yellow good.

3047
01:43:35,960 --> 01:43:37,160
Yellow good.

3048
01:43:37,160 --> 01:43:38,660
Yellow so good.

3049
01:43:38,660 --> 01:43:41,060
Yay!

3050
01:43:40,860 --> 01:43:42,060
Sacrifice me!

3051
01:43:42,360 --> 01:43:44,160
よいしょ。
Heave-ho.

3052
01:43:43,960 --> 01:43:47,660
What do I do? It's a dagger! Ancient dagger.

3053
01:43:48,660 --> 01:43:52,360
Aaah! Aaah!

3054
01:43:52,360 --> 01:43:54,460
のじゃ？何してるの？
Noja? What are you doing?

3055
01:43:52,460 --> 01:43:53,660
Whoa!

3056
01:43:54,160 --> 01:43:55,660
Aah, sacrifice!

3057
01:43:55,660 --> 01:43:57,010
Sacrifice!

3058
01:43:57,010 --> 01:43:58,360
What are you doing?!

3059
01:43:58,060 --> 01:43:59,160
I'm...

3060
01:43:59,110 --> 01:43:59,960
Aah!

3061
01:43:59,860 --> 01:44:01,360
大丈夫？怖い！
Are you okay? Scary!

3062
01:44:00,960 --> 01:44:02,160
Aah!

3063
01:44:02,260 --> 01:44:05,860
ねえ、これさ、うちらより重いかもしんない。
Hey, this might be heavier than us.

3064
01:44:03,360 --> 01:44:04,960
You're not getting hurt or anything.

3065
01:44:05,860 --> 01:44:07,960
怖い！これ何でやってるの？
Scary! Why are they doing this?

3066
01:44:06,760 --> 01:44:09,760
I don't know. That's also the first time I saw that.

3067
01:44:09,760 --> 01:44:11,760
斬り合ってる。わかんない、多分痴話喧嘩だと思うこれ。
They're slashing at each other. I dunno, maybe it's a lovers' quarrel.

3068
01:44:11,760 --> 01:44:12,760
あ、痴話喧嘩。
Ah, a lovers' quarrel.

3069
01:44:12,760 --> 01:44:14,360
重いから。うちらより重いわ、この人たち。
Because they're heavy. Those two are heavier than us.

3070
01:44:14,360 --> 01:44:15,360
怖い。
Scary.

3071
01:44:15,360 --> 01:44:17,360
すげえ、すげえ！だって...
Amazing, amazing! Look...

3072
01:44:17,060 --> 01:44:19,660
Whoa! What are you doing?!

3073
01:44:17,460 --> 01:44:19,160
え、固まっちゃった！
Eh, she froze!

3074
01:44:20,060 --> 01:44:21,360
先輩！
Senpai!

3075
01:44:20,660 --> 01:44:24,160
[Title: 熱帯 二日目]
[Title: Tropics Day 2]

3076
01:44:20,960 --> 01:44:23,160
What did you do?! Kaela-senpai!

3077
01:44:21,760 --> 01:44:23,960
Kaela-senpai! Sayonara, Kaela-senpai!

3078
01:44:24,160 --> 01:44:25,260
Aah!

3079
01:44:25,260 --> 01:44:26,260
死んじゃった？
Did she die?

3080
01:44:25,660 --> 01:44:29,160
She told me to! She told me to sacrifice her!

3081
01:44:29,160 --> 01:44:31,560
何？！どうなっちゃったの？！
What?! What happened to her?!

3082
01:44:31,460 --> 01:44:32,460
What is this?!

3083
01:44:32,360 --> 01:44:33,560
What did I do?!

3084
01:44:33,360 --> 01:44:34,860
What happened?!

3085
01:44:35,160 --> 01:44:36,160
待って。
Wait.

3086
01:44:35,860 --> 01:44:37,360
Wait, what did that do?!

3087
01:44:37,360 --> 01:44:39,360
あ、スタミナがいっぱいある。
Ah, we have lots of stamina.

3088
01:44:41,160 --> 01:44:42,560
犠牲になった？
She became a sacrifice?

3089
01:44:45,160 --> 01:44:46,460
Wait, why is she big?

3090
01:44:46,460 --> 01:44:47,860
ストーン！なんで？
Stone! Why?

3091
01:44:47,760 --> 01:44:48,660
Hello?

3092
01:44:48,660 --> 01:44:50,260
なんで石になっちゃった？
Why did she turn to stone?

3093
01:44:50,260 --> 01:44:52,860
Have fun! Good luck! You can do it!

3094
01:44:52,660 --> 01:44:55,960
What?! No, no, no, no, I didn't... we need you, we need you!

3095
01:44:55,960 --> 01:44:57,160
Let's go!

3096
01:44:57,160 --> 01:44:58,160
なんでまだ...
Why is she still...

3097
01:44:57,360 --> 01:44:59,160
Woo! Eat all of the food!

3098
01:44:59,260 --> 01:45:00,160
えー...
Ehh...

3099
01:45:00,448 --> 01:45:01,048
Nice!

3100
01:45:01,048 --> 01:45:02,318
まだ、まだ始めないで！
Wait, don't start yet!

3101
01:45:01,368 --> 01:45:04,068
Watch our stream! Let's go!

3102
01:45:04,068 --> 01:45:07,768
Kaela! Why did you make me... How did you...

3103
01:45:07,768 --> 01:45:08,968
なんで！？
Why?!

3104
01:45:09,068 --> 01:45:10,468
Where's all of the food?!

3105
01:45:10,568 --> 01:45:11,768
あ、死んじゃった！
Oh, she died!

3106
01:45:11,168 --> 01:45:13,368
The fire will run out!

3107
01:45:13,468 --> 01:45:15,268
なんで死んじゃったの？
Why did she die?

3108
01:45:15,268 --> 01:45:17,568
これ、刺されたみたい、この...
It looks like she got poked by this...

3109
01:45:17,368 --> 01:45:19,368
刺されたら死んじゃうの！？
You die if you get poked?!

3110
01:45:19,568 --> 01:45:21,268
死んじゃったみたい。
Looks like she died.

3111
01:45:21,268 --> 01:45:22,968
Why noja...

3112
01:45:24,968 --> 01:45:26,868
So there's no way you can come back to life?

3113
01:45:26,868 --> 01:45:28,668
No, there's no way. Let's go.

3114
01:45:28,368 --> 01:45:29,668
あ、もう帰れないんだ！
Oh, she can't come back!

3115
01:45:29,668 --> 01:45:30,768
What?

3116
01:45:30,968 --> 01:45:39,368
I will come back if you found the Scout's Effigy or you reach the peak, uh, the next peak.

3117
01:45:39,568 --> 01:45:42,168
Oh, so this one doesn't work.

3118
01:45:42,268 --> 01:45:42,968
No.

3119
01:45:43,068 --> 01:45:44,168
怖い...
Scary...

3120
01:45:43,968 --> 01:45:46,968
We get the dagger from there. We get the dagger from there.

3121
01:45:47,268 --> 01:45:48,668
ん？これ落とした？
Hm? Did I drop this?

3122
01:45:47,968 --> 01:45:49,068
Oh no.

3123
01:45:49,068 --> 01:45:52,868
Okay, you can do it! All of the practice paid off, right? Let's go!

3124
01:45:50,268 --> 01:45:51,168
そんな...
No way...

3125
01:45:52,868 --> 01:45:58,368
Okay, okay, okay. We gonna show it to her. Master... Master Kaela watching us.

3126
01:46:01,168 --> 01:46:02,568
So good...

3127
01:46:02,268 --> 01:46:04,368
背中のさ、ココナッツ出すね。
I'll take the coconut out of your backpack.

3128
01:46:03,368 --> 01:46:04,968
Did you feel good?

3129
01:46:04,668 --> 01:46:05,468
重いから。
Since it's heavy.

3130
01:46:05,668 --> 01:46:07,768
ココナッツじゃなくて違うのにするね。
I'll swap the coconut for something else.

3131
01:46:05,668 --> 01:46:08,668
You like that? You like that?

3132
01:46:08,668 --> 01:46:10,468
ありがとう。
Thank you.

3133
01:46:10,468 --> 01:46:11,968
マシュマロとかでいい？
Is a marshmallow or something okay?

3134
01:46:11,268 --> 01:46:13,968
Thank you so much. Now I can relax.

3135
01:46:14,968 --> 01:46:18,668
You're welcome. I'll take your body with us. Come on, let's go.

3136
01:46:18,668 --> 01:46:20,268
そんなあ...
No way...

3137
01:46:20,768 --> 01:46:22,368
オッケー、交換した。
Okay, swapped it.

3138
01:46:22,368 --> 01:46:26,868
I'll roll your body to the peak. We'll roll your body... or into the fire. Let's cook you.

3139
01:46:26,968 --> 01:46:29,968
カエラ先輩ー！
Kaela-senpai!

3140
01:46:29,968 --> 01:46:31,968
Cook the Kaela-senpai.

3141
01:46:32,168 --> 01:46:33,668
Yeah, there you go.

3142
01:46:34,168 --> 01:46:37,468
Time to eat lunch. Oh yeah, that's actually a good thing.

3143
01:46:37,468 --> 01:46:38,568
Goodだな。
That's good.

3144
01:46:38,568 --> 01:46:40,168
What food? Yeah...

3145
01:46:42,168 --> 01:46:43,668
Look at the food!

3146
01:46:44,168 --> 01:46:45,768
死んじゃった。
She died.

3147
01:46:46,468 --> 01:46:47,968
無限にある、食べ物。
There's infinite food.

3148
01:46:47,968 --> 01:46:49,868
ね、めっちゃある。入りきらないぐらいある。
Yeah, there's tons. More than we can even carry.

3149
01:46:49,968 --> 01:46:55,668
We have to show Kaela that we can do it. We have to go. We have to save Kaela!

3150
01:46:54,668 --> 01:46:56,968
確かに！見せよう！カエラ先輩に！
True! Let's show Kaela-senpai!

3151
01:46:56,968 --> 01:47:01,668
Hey, just leave the coconut! What is going on?! Why?! The coconut!

3152
01:47:01,668 --> 01:47:04,368
Just eat all of the coconut for energy! For energy!

3153
01:47:04,368 --> 01:47:08,668
No, my energy's maxed out! Maxed out, maxed out, thanks to you.

3154
01:47:08,768 --> 01:47:12,768
Maybe、カエラ先輩の代償じゃない？死の代償？
Maybe it's the price of Kaela-senpai? The price of death?

3155
01:47:12,968 --> 01:47:16,368
Your sacrifice gave us all stamina.

3156
01:47:16,568 --> 01:47:22,168
Oh, I see! Okay, okay, okay, okay, okay. Nice sacrifice then. Okay, let's go.

3157
01:47:22,268 --> 01:47:24,968
のじゃ... 悲しいのじゃ...
Noja... It's sad noja...

3158
01:47:25,368 --> 01:47:28,268
Okay, so we go... we go that way like we did last time.

3159
01:47:28,268 --> 01:47:29,568
Yes? Okay.

3160
01:47:29,968 --> 01:47:32,468
Let's move fast. Let's go.

3161
01:47:32,568 --> 01:47:34,468
もっと速い！もっと...
Faster! More...

3162
01:47:34,568 --> 01:47:36,968
カエラ先輩を助ける！
We'll save Kaela-senpai!

3163
01:47:37,368 --> 01:47:38,668
Yeah, 助ける！
Yeah, we'll save her!

3164
01:47:38,668 --> 01:47:42,368
Don't worry, I like this. It's very relaxing.

3165
01:47:42,468 --> 01:47:43,568
のじゃ...
Noja...

3166
01:47:44,568 --> 01:47:46,968
Yeah, you can relax for a bit.

3167
01:47:47,268 --> 01:47:49,668
よいしょ、よいしょ... やあ！
Heave-ho, heave-ho... Wah!

3168
01:47:50,068 --> 01:47:51,968
わはっ！大丈夫？
Whoa! Are you okay?

3169
01:47:51,968 --> 01:47:53,668
大丈夫！A little bit.
I'm okay! A little bit.

3170
01:47:53,668 --> 01:47:54,468
Okay.

3171
01:47:54,568 --> 01:47:56,968
ちょっとだけやっちゃった。
I messed up just a little.

3172
01:47:58,168 --> 01:47:59,768
I'm not good at.
I'm not good at it.

3173
01:48:00,968 --> 01:48:02,568
Which vine did we take?

3174
01:48:02,868 --> 01:48:04,868
よいしょ、よいしょ。
Heave-ho, heave-ho.

3175
01:48:04,968 --> 01:48:07,268
Oh well, any vine will do.

3176
01:48:07,268 --> 01:48:09,368
ちょっとだけ傷つけちゃった。
I hurt myself just a little.

3177
01:48:09,968 --> 01:48:11,168
よいしょ。
Heave-ho.

3178
01:48:11,168 --> 01:48:12,968
どっちから行ったのかな、キョーコ？
Which way did you go, Kyoko?

3179
01:48:12,968 --> 01:48:14,068
そっちかな？
That way maybe?

3180
01:48:14,068 --> 01:48:16,968
This way? Maybe this way?

3181
01:48:19,068 --> 01:48:20,568
Ummm...

3182
01:48:20,668 --> 01:48:22,968
And... right here?

3183
01:48:23,468 --> 01:48:28,668
こうやって、登って登ってキョーコのもとに...
Like this, climbing, climbing toward Kyoko...

3184
01:48:29,468 --> 01:48:30,768
えっ！？ああっ！！
Huh?! Ahh!!

3185
01:48:30,768 --> 01:48:31,668
落ちる！
I'm falling!

3186
01:48:31,768 --> 01:48:34,368
Whoa! You did it in a better way!

3187
01:48:34,368 --> 01:48:35,368
すごい！
Amazing!

3188
01:48:35,368 --> 01:48:36,668
Yeah!

3189
01:48:38,068 --> 01:48:39,368
これちょっと怖いな。
This is a little scary.

3190
01:48:39,368 --> 01:48:41,668
That's much better way!

3191
01:48:41,368 --> 01:48:45,368
Weee! Whooo!

3192
01:48:44,168 --> 01:48:46,968
すごーい！
Amazing!

3193
01:48:46,968 --> 01:48:48,668
いいな... すごいすごい、かっこいい！
Nice... So cool, so cool!

3194
01:48:48,668 --> 01:48:50,668
感動しそう！ああ、危ない！
I could cry! Oh, watch out!

3195
01:48:52,368 --> 01:48:54,668
超かっこいい！スライダーいいな。
Super cool! That zipline looks fun.

3196
01:48:54,768 --> 01:48:56,968
あ、こっち来ちゃダメ... あ、ごめんね。
Oh, don't come this way... Oh, sorry.

3197
01:48:56,968 --> 01:48:58,068
来ちゃダメだった。
I shouldn't have come here.

3198
01:48:58,068 --> 01:49:00,268
あのね、そう、降りたくなかった本当は。
Actually, yeah, I didn't want to drop down.

3199
01:49:00,268 --> 01:49:01,968
あ、でも待とうか、1回。
Oh, let's wait here for a bit.

3200
01:49:01,468 --> 01:49:02,168
Okay.

3201
01:49:02,268 --> 01:49:03,368
待ちましょう。
Let's wait.

3202
01:49:03,568 --> 01:49:04,768
雨は危ない。
Rain is dangerous.

3203
01:49:04,768 --> 01:49:05,768
雨危ない。
Rain is dangerous.

3204
01:49:07,068 --> 01:49:09,268
カエラ先輩いないの怖いな。
It's scary without Kaela-senpai.

3205
01:49:09,268 --> 01:49:10,468
ね、心細いよね。
Yeah, it makes you feel lonely.

3206
01:49:10,568 --> 01:49:11,168
うん。
Yeah.

3207
01:49:11,268 --> 01:49:14,368
まさかあれでダメになっちゃうなんて思わなかったのじゃ。
I never thought that would take her out noja.

3208
01:49:14,868 --> 01:49:17,368
Climb the tree, climb the tree.

3209
01:49:17,468 --> 01:49:18,168
Tree?

3210
01:49:17,968 --> 01:49:19,768
Yeah, we'll try, we'll try.

3211
01:49:19,968 --> 01:49:22,568
How? Here? First like here and...

3212
01:49:22,968 --> 01:49:24,968
こっち行って飛び移るのがいいのかな？
Should I go this way and jump across?

3213
01:49:24,968 --> 01:49:26,968
えっとね、ここから行って...
Let's see, go from here...

3214
01:49:26,268 --> 01:49:26,968
Wait!

3215
01:49:27,368 --> 01:49:28,268
よいしょ。
Heave-ho.

3216
01:49:28,268 --> 01:49:30,168
Wait, Bibu-senpai!

3217
01:49:30,168 --> 01:49:31,668
Whoa!

3218
01:49:31,668 --> 01:49:34,368
You can just go up. Oh okay. You can just go up.

3219
01:49:34,868 --> 01:49:35,768
よいしょ。
Heave-ho.

3220
01:49:35,768 --> 01:49:37,368
わいー！あれ？
Whee! Huh?

3221
01:49:37,368 --> 01:49:38,668
あれ？あれ？
Huh? Huh?

3222
01:49:38,668 --> 01:49:40,368
キョーコ大丈夫？
Kyoko, are you okay?

3223
01:49:40,368 --> 01:49:41,668
Go up.

3224
01:49:41,968 --> 01:49:43,968
Oh, it was the wrong way.

3225
01:49:43,968 --> 01:49:45,568
Grab the leaves there...

3226
01:49:45,368 --> 01:49:46,968
大丈夫？大丈夫？
Are you okay? Are you okay?

3227
01:49:46,968 --> 01:49:47,668
うん。
Yeah.

3228
01:49:47,668 --> 01:49:48,668
よいしょ。
Heave-ho.

3229
01:49:48,668 --> 01:49:49,668
ほっ！よいしょ。
Hup! Heave-ho.

3230
01:49:49,668 --> 01:49:52,368
よいしょ、よいしょ。
Heave-ho, heave-ho.

3231
01:49:53,268 --> 01:49:54,968
キョーコどこだ？こっちか。
Where's Kyoko? Over here.

3232
01:49:55,168 --> 01:49:56,568
下いるよ、大丈夫だよ。
