Oh, I can hear her voice now though!

4165
02:23:12,624 --> 02:23:14,924
でもね、声ね、結構遠くで聞こえんのよ。
Yeah, but you can hear voices from pretty far away.

4166
02:23:15,024 --> 02:23:15,724
そうか。
I see.

4167
02:23:15,774 --> 02:23:16,724
...the rain.

4168
02:23:16,824 --> 02:23:18,624
結構下だ。
She's pretty far down.

4169
02:23:18,674 --> 02:23:20,324
...looping though. Should I keep going?

4170
02:23:20,424 --> 02:23:25,024
What if the blue thing is the her thingy? I don't know. I don't know guys.
What if the blue thing is her thingy? I don't know. I don't know, guys.

4171
02:23:26,624 --> 02:23:30,424
I think so before I look at it when I...

4172
02:23:30,474 --> 02:23:33,324
...just avoid, avoid...

4173
02:23:33,424 --> 02:23:34,524
上手！
Nice!

4174
02:23:34,574 --> 02:23:36,024
Uh... avoid!

4175
