Okay! Ha, oh my god! Oh my god!
Okay! Oh my god! Oh my god!

4179
02:23:42,074 --> 02:23:44,224
危ない、it's scary. 怖い。
Careful, it's scary. Scary.

4180
02:23:44,274 --> 02:23:45,324
危ない、オッケー。
Careful, okay.

4181
02:23:44,824 --> 02:23:45,924
Great, great.

4182
02:23:47,324 --> 02:23:48,424
上手！
Nice!

4183
02:23:49,124 --> 02:23:50,824
Okay, okay!

4184
