4199
02:24:18,474 --> 02:24:21,024
Ooh! Oh, what is that?

4200
02:24:21,224 --> 02:24:24,424
Oh no, okay, well, I'm just gonna hold on to that. Okay.

4201
02:24:24,624 --> 02:24:26,624
Why did that hurt me?!

4202
02:24:26,924 --> 02:24:30,024
