4203
02:24:30,424 --> 02:24:32,524
You can go... uh...

4204
02:24:32,624 --> 02:24:34,124
行けるかにゃ。
Can she make it?

4205
02:24:34,924 --> 02:24:37,024
That's pretty hard with the...

4206
02:24:37,124 --> 02:24:38,424
むずそう。
Looks tough.

4207
02:24:38,524 --> 02:24:40,424
I mean, you... I mean...

4208
02:24:40,524 --> 02:24:43,224
Yeah, I can use my energy drink to get up this way.

4209
02:24:43,724 --> 02:24:47,324
I'm gonna risk it because I don't think I can go up there otherwise.

4210
02:24:47,424 --> 02:24:48,624
Maybe I can.

4211
02:24:48,724 --> 02:24:50,324
よいしょ。
Heave-ho.

4212
02:24:50,724 --> 02:24:52,024
よいしょ！
Heave-ho!

4213
02:24:52,074 --> 02:24:54,524
よいしょー！
Heave-ho!

4214
02:24:57,024 --> 02:24:58,224
あっ…
Ah...

4215
