眠くなっちゃう。
It makes you sleepy.

4224
02:25:12,832 --> 02:25:14,932
うん、ちょっと sleepy。
Yeah, a little sleepy.

4225
02:25:14,932 --> 02:25:17,032
ちょっと sleepy なっちゃうのじゃ。
It makes you a little sleepy-noja.

