あ、すごい！上手！
Oh, amazing! You're good!

4230
02:25:26,232 --> 02:25:27,632
That's the Tenacity!

4231
02:25:27,332 --> 02:25:28,732
Tenacity!

4232
02:25:29,132 --> 02:25:30,832
Yeah, the Tenacity thing.

4233
02:25:31,432 --> 02:25:32,132
Okay.

4234
02:25:32,132 --> 02:25:32,932
Okay.

4235
02:25:32,932 --> 02:25:34,132
Let me use it now?

4236
02:25:33,732 --> 02:25:35,732
No, no, just keep going.

4237
