Tenacity is the one that will not get hurt.

4238
02:25:40,232 --> 02:25:41,732
The immune one.

4239
02:25:40,232 --> 02:25:41,032
うん。
Yeah.

4240
02:25:45,432 --> 02:25:46,732
Okay, okay!

4241
02:25:46,432 --> 02:25:47,332
オッケー？
Okay?

4242
