4243
02:25:47,232 --> 02:25:50,132
Tenacity is the heal one? Oh, really? Not the immune one?

4244
02:25:49,732 --> 02:25:50,532
えっと…
Um...

4245
02:25:50,432 --> 02:25:52,132
Tenacity is... It's the heal one.

4246
02:25:52,232 --> 02:25:53,732
Oh, it's a heal one, nice.

4247
