02:56:40,280 --> 02:56:42,680
It's okay, we can go around it.

5149
02:56:42,680 --> 02:56:44,280
Yes! Wow!

5150
02:56:44,280 --> 02:56:45,880
かっこいい！先輩かっこいい！
So cool! Senpai is so cool!

5151
02:56:45,880 --> 02:56:47,380
先輩かっこいい！
Senpai is so cool!

5152
02:56:47,380 --> 02:56:48,780
先輩かっこいい！
Senpai is so cool!

5153
02:56:49,080 --> 02:56:50,880
Cool senpai noja.
Cool senpai-noja.

5154
02:56:52,380 --> 02:56:53,880
Okay, uh, up?

5155
02:56:53,880 --> 02:56:55,780
アップ？Up here?
Up? Up here?

5156
02:56:55,780 --> 02:56:58,180
Yeah, up, up, up is okay.

5157
02:56:57,780 --> 02:56:59,480
Up is okay, thank you.

5158
