5159
02:57:02,280 --> 02:57:03,980
Great! ありがとう！
Great! Thank you!

5160
02:57:03,980 --> 02:57:05,380
And then this way.

5161
02:57:05,380 --> 02:57:06,680
This way. こっち。
This way. Over here.

5162
02:57:06,680 --> 02:57:09,080
Oh yeah, I see the platform. Yeah, platform here.

5163
02:57:09,180 --> 02:57:13,480
いい感じ。え、なんか今のとこすごいいい感じの道なんじゃない？お主ら。
