5164
02:57:13,480 --> 02:57:15,380
いいんじゃない？よいしょ、よいしょ。
Isn't it good? Hup, hup.

5165
02:57:15,380 --> 02:57:17,480
Okay, now we're in a good spot, I think.

5166
02:57:17,480 --> 02:57:18,480
Thank you!

5167
02:57:19,280 --> 02:57:20,180
はい。
Here.

5168
02:57:20,380 --> 02:57:22,680
