5208
02:58:47,980 --> 02:58:49,280
Oh, nice, nice, nice!

5209
02:58:49,280 --> 02:58:55,080
大丈夫！I'm alive! 大丈夫、まだ生きてる！まだ生きてる！
I'm okay! I'm alive! I'm okay, I'm still alive! I'm still alive!

5210
