Okay.

5302
03:03:47,088 --> 03:03:52,988
Move... okay, okay, okay. Go front, go front a little bit, little bit, little bit. Little bit more. Okay, okay, okay, okay.

5303
03:03:52,988 --> 03:03:53,688
Okay!

5304
03:03:53,988 --> 03:03:55,788
のじゃー！
Noja!

5305
03:03:56,288 --> 03:03:57,288
Okay.

5306
03:03:57,288 --> 03:03:58,888
Thank you!

5307
03:03:58,988 --> 03:03:59,988
Okay.

5308
03:03:59,788 --> 03:04:01,288
