Ah, Kaela-senpai!

5309
03:04:01,288 --> 03:04:03,488
I can... I'm... Do you want this?

5310
03:04:03,488 --> 03:04:04,988
Okay, Rope Cannon...

5311
03:04:04,588 --> 03:04:05,988
I can't use it.

5312
03:04:05,488 --> 03:04:06,888
We can...

5313
