5316
03:04:14,188 --> 03:04:16,488
カエラ先輩、I have スカウトキャノン too.
Kaela-senpai, I have a Scout Cannon too.

5317
03:04:16,288 --> 03:04:20,788
What, what, what... whoa, whoa. How can you use...

5318
