Can I eat carrot? Can I eat carrot?

5324
03:04:38,088 --> 03:04:39,288
Carrot?

5325
03:04:39,288 --> 03:04:40,988
Can I eat this?

5326
03:04:40,988 --> 03:04:41,988
Oh, this one?

5327
03:04:41,888 --> 03:04:42,888
Yes!

5328
03:04:43,088 --> 03:04:44,088
You hurt?

5329
03:04:43,988 --> 03:04:45,888
Yes, I'm hurt. Thank you!

5330
03:04:45,688 --> 03:04:47,388
Okay, okay, okay, okay.

5331
03:04:47,388 --> 03:04:48,288
Thank you!

5332
03:04:48,288 --> 03:04:51,788
And then... ちょっと…
And then... wait...

5333
03:04:52,488 --> 03:04:53,488
Okay.

5334
03:04:53,988 --> 03:04:56,288
Now we can go...

5335
03:04:56,588 --> 03:04:58,488
What is that?

5336
03:05:00,546 --> 03:05:01,296
Okay.

5337
03:05:01,796 --> 03:05:02,696
Wait.

5338
03:05:03,496 --> 03:05:05,096
先輩にあげよう。
I'll give this to Senpai.

5339
03:05:06,096 --> 03:05:07,396
先輩にあげよう。
I'll give this to Senpai.

5340
03:05:07,896 --> 03:05:08,796
Okay.

5341
03:05:09,396 --> 03:05:11,296
Uh, go this way?

5342
03:05:11,296 --> 03:05:12,896
Go this way?

5343
