Energy okay?
Is your energy okay?

5347
03:05:19,596 --> 03:05:21,596
Energy? What?

5348
03:05:21,796 --> 03:05:23,696
Your energy is good? No?

5349
03:05:23,796 --> 03:05:25,996
Uh, only half.

5350
03:05:26,396 --> 03:05:28,196
Okay, half... Um...

5351
03:05:29,796 --> 03:05:31,796
Actually, less than half.

5352
03:05:32,596 --> 03:05:35,096
